# iCloud / Finder conflict copies (repo lives under a synced Desktop)
* 2.*
* 3.*
* [0-9].mdx
# …and the extensionless variants. The patterns above need a dot after the
# digit, so dotfile conflicts like ".nvmrc 2" slipped through and showed up as
# untracked — which the scheduled jobs would have committed via `git add -A`.
* [0-9]
* [0-9] *

# Deploy scratch log written next to the repo by scripts/deploy.sh
.deploy_run.log

# Launch kit (local only, not for the public repo)
launch/
